Computes the curried tree hash of `AddDelegatedPuzzleWrapper(restriction_hash, inner_delegated_puzzle_hash)`.

Combines a 32-byte MIPS restriction wrapper commitment with the 32-byte inner delegated puzzle
hash via domain-separated `SHA-256(0x01 || restriction_hash || inner_delegated_puzzle_hash)`
([`crate::merkle::dig_hash_pair`]).

# Arguments

* `restriction_hash` - 32-byte commitment hash of the outer condition-filtering restriction puzzle.
* `inner_delegated_puzzle_hash` - 32-byte tree hash of the inner delegated puzzle being wrapped.

# Returns

The 32-byte curried wrapper puzzle tree hash.

# Complexity

`O(1)` time (one 65-byte SHA-256 digest) and `O(1)` stack space.

# Examples

```rust
use dbrain_core_rs::clear_signing::wrap_delegated_puzzle_hash;
use dbrain_core_rs::merkle::dig_hash_pair;

let restriction = [0x10u8; 32];
let inner = [0x20u8; 32];
let wrapped = wrap_delegated_puzzle_hash(&restriction, &inner);

assert_eq!(wrapped, dig_hash_pair(&restriction, &inner));
```

