Extracts `16` orthogonal `10-bit` LSH band keys (`[u16; 16]`) from a `1,024-bit` signature.

Masks the lowest 10 hyperplane bits (`& 0x03ff`, yielding bucket IDs in `0..1024`) from each of
the 16 `u64` words of `sig`, producing 16 independent band keys for [`MultiProbeLshIndex1024`]
and [`compute_lsh_canopy_topic_id`].

# Arguments

* `sig` - 1,024-bit (`[u64; 16]`) SimHash / BQ signature.

# Returns

Array of 16 ten-bit band bucket keys (`each in 0..=1023`).

# Complexity

`O(1)` time (16 bitmask truncations) and `O(1)` stack space.

# Examples

```rust
use dbrain_core_rs::recall::{compute_bq_embedding_1024, extract_lsh_bands_16x16};

let sig = compute_bq_embedding_1024("multi probe locality sensitive hashing");
let bands = extract_lsh_bands_16x16(&sig);

for &b in &bands {
    assert!(b <= 0x03ff);
}
```

